              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hoshea muyaayi wa Azazia yaali mwimiliri wi ihiiri ya Efuraimu. Joeli muyaayi wa Pedaya yaali mwimiliri wi inusu yi ihiiri ya Manase, iyaali kolovega lwi Madioli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.27.20",
